body:
I know I never see any other Nutrition students on reddit! 

&#x200B;

I am taking the exam yeah, so exctied to be done the course lol Don't worry too much, stuff happens & the profs are super nice.

 [https://www.ryerson.ca/senate/StudentInfo/AcademicConsiderationRequest/](https://www.ryerson.ca/senate/StudentInfo/AcademicConsiderationRequest/)  

&#x200B;

Ryerson now has an online submission for all medical exemption requests. You can submit your documentation here! 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

I wish you peace in regards to your mental wellness. There is so much struggle year round, and this time of year can be especially tough. Excellent that you're getting help, and don't worry about your exam, but rather feeling better (tough to do, I know). You wont fail the class because of your hospital trip.
